\">可观的被动技适用于骑枪物理输出角色。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/25/50494840/c8935048fddffe315c844aad2451251b_9104875994098119733.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>明日福音</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">可观的被动技适用于骑枪物理输出角色。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/e831a7f80cca790c35d2d3a4bf101b63_8257815688323469050.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动提高物伤，暴击率和武器技全伤，主动技突刺攻击的倍率略低于永寂之赫勒尔；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">物理输出向骑枪武器，其他角色使用时可享受被动技能的加成效果；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">天元骑英使用时，通过【炮击】可提升输出和循环能力，增加玩法的趣味性。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/01/24/50494840/e831a7f80cca790c35d2d3a4bf101b63_8257815688323469050.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n     